WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.170
In 1374 Leo V was crowned at Sis,

2
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.895
the capital of Armenian Cilicia.

3
00:00:08.935 --> 00:00:12.365
Within months a Mamluk army
took the town,

4
00:00:12.405 --> 00:00:15.542
and the king held out
behind the castle walls.

5
00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:19.332
In April 1375 he accepted terms,

6
00:00:19.372 --> 00:00:21.661
and the kingdom came to an end.

7
00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:26.645
Freed in 1382,
he died in Paris in 1393.

8
00:00:26.885 --> 00:00:29.560
Hold the castle for the king.

